<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>redirecting voucher page</title>
</head>
<body>
<script>
// Client-side redirect: the tapped URL navigates away to a DIFFERENT
// voucher's page. The capture wrapper is bound to the tapped URL's token,
// so the redirected page's payload must never be captured for this load.
// (A server-side 302 cannot be simulated: WebResourceResponse rejects 3xx
// status codes, and WebViewAssetLoader cannot serve redirects - a JS
// navigation is the closest achievable fixture and exercises the same
// property.)
window.location.replace('https://appassets.androidplatform.net/TestToken1');
</script>
</body>
</html>
